Package: zugrpc
Title: Client for 'gRPC' Remote Procedure Calls over 'HTTP/2'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: A client for 'gRPC' remote procedure calls, written in 'R' on
    top of the 'HTTP/2' requests that 'zuhttp' makes. Implements the 'gRPC'
    wire protocol: length-prefixed messages, request headers and metadata,
    deadlines, cancellation, and the call status carried in 'HTTP' trailers,
    with error details decoded into structured conditions. Supports unary
    and server-streaming calls, with streamed responses read one message at
    a time. Messages are encoded and decoded by the caller, for example
    with 'zuproto'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-GB
